  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Water meter",
    "type_designations": ["sonico EDGE"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Ultrasonic water meters type sonico EDGE designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. Consist of a cast iron body with connecting screw threads, one pair of ultrasonic transducers and an electronic indicating device formed by an LCD display showing volume and flow. Volume resolution of 0.0001 m³ and 0.001 m³ on the digital display. Software separation with SW version and CRC displayed on the LCD. Indicates delivered volume for reverse flow and forward flow separately every two minutes; permanently shown delivered volume is the difference of the two. Can be equipped by an impulse module which is not part of this certificate. Powered by 24 V DC mains with a battery in the meter body for temporary power failure; magnetic ferrite shielding on mains power cable. Shall be installed to operate in arbitrary positions. Sealing by plastic seal on plastic meter cover and meter body screw; lock ferrite on cable sealed by security sticker and wire security seal."
